@startuml
!include https://static.visual-paradigm.com/web/resources/plantuml-stdlib/themes/vp.puml

title Auth - Admin Login

skinparam shadowing false
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam activityFontName Arial
skinparam activityFontSize 14
skinparam activityBorderThickness 1.5
skinparam ArrowThickness 1.5
skinparam ArrowColor #222222
skinparam SwimlaneBorderColor #222222
skinparam SwimlaneBorderThickness 2
skinparam activity {
  BackgroundColor #7DD3FC
  BorderColor #2563EB
  DiamondBackgroundColor #7DD3FC
  DiamondBorderColor #2563EB
  StartColor #111827
  EndColor #FFFFFF
}

|Guest|
start
note right
Precondition:
Guest is not authenticated.

Postcondition:
The account is logged in when the
credentials are correct.
end note
:Open the login function;
|System|
:Display the login form;
|Guest|
repeat
  :Enter the email and password;
  :Submit the login request;
  |System|
  :Check the login credentials;
  if (The system fails to process the request?) then (Yes)
    :Return the system error;
    |Guest|
    :View the error message;
    stop
  else (No)
  endif
  |System|
  if (The email or password is incorrect?) then (Yes)
    :Return the incorrect-credentials error;
    |Guest|
    :View the notice;
  else (No)
    |System|
    :Log the account in and return the result;
    |Guest|
    :View the login result;
    stop
  endif
  |Guest|
  :Re-enter the login information;
repeat while (Sign in\nagain?) is (Yes) not (No)
stop

@enduml
